# Merging into the main checkout

When merging a branch from a worktree into the main repository checkout (`/Users/dskachkov/Projects/personal/LCdrData`, branch `develop`), always squash.

```bash
git merge --squash <branch>
git commit
```

Do not create a merge commit. Do not push unless asked. Leave the main checkout's untracked `.cursor/` directory out of the commit.
